When your pet picks up the money move and wait until the pet is on the 
'shopkeeper' spot.

Back up if necessary but wait until your pet steps out of the shop.

Approach carefully: if the pet moves inside shop back up.

When you are next to your pet move towards the pet to exchange places.

If you don't succseed back up to the appropriate plae depending if your 
pet is next to you or not.

If you succseed then your pet is in the corridor opposite to the shop 
relevant to you. Let it roam until it drops the gold. Go get the gold 
and start again.


